455	37	Bẫy Causative trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Causative trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. HAVE + người\n\n**have + person + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager had the assistant check the report.\n\nKhông:\n\nhad the assistant to check ❌\n\n## 2. GET + người\n\n**get + person + to V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager got the assistant to check the report.\n\nKhông:\n\ngot the assistant check ❌\n\n## 3. MAKE + người\n\n**make + person + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager made the employees attend the meeting.\n\nKhông:\n\nmade the employees to attend ❌\n\nNhưng ở bị động:\n\nThe employees were made **to attend** the meeting. ✅\n\n## 4. LET + người\n\n**let + person + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager let the employees leave early.\n\n## 5. HELP\n\n**help + person + V**\n\nhoặc:\n\n**help + person + to V**\n\nCả hai đều đúng.\n\n## 6. HAVE/GET + vật\n\n**have + object + V3**\n\n**get + object + V3**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nWe had the equipment repaired.\n\nWe got the equipment repaired.\n\n## 7. Ví dụ tổng hợp\n\nThe manager had the technician ______ the machine.\n\nA. repair\nB. to repair\nC. repaired\nD. repairing\n\nĐáp án: **A. repair**\n\n---\n\nThe manager got the technician ______ the machine.\n\nA. repair\nB. to repair\nC. repaired\nD. repairing\n\nĐáp án: **B. to repair**\n\n---\n\nThe manager had the machine ______.\n\nA. repair\nB. to repair\nC. repaired\nD. repairing\n\nĐáp án: **C. repaired**\n\n---\n\nThe employees were made ______ overtime.\n\nA. work\nB. to work\nC. worked\nD. working\n\nĐáp án: **B. to work**\n\n## 8. Công thức nhớ nhanh\n\n**HAVE + người + V**\n\n**GET + người + TO V**\n\n**MAKE + người + V**\n\n**LET + người + V**\n\n**HELP + người + V / TO V**\n\n**HAVE + vật + V3**\n\n**GET + vật + V3**\n\n**BE MADE + TO V**\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:13:47.650757	2026-08-08 20:13:47.650757	\N
