587	51	Reported Speech là gì?	\n\n# Reported Speech là gì?\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nReported Speech (câu tường thuật) được sử dụng để thuật lại lời nói hoặc thông tin mà một người đã nói trước đó.\n\nCó hai dạng chính:\n\n- Direct Speech: lời nói trực tiếp.\n- Reported Speech: lời nói được tường thuật lại.\n\n## 2. Direct Speech\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager said, "The meeting is at 9 a.m."\n\n→ Người quản lý nói: "Cuộc họp lúc 9 giờ sáng."\n\n## 3. Reported Speech\n\nCó thể chuyển thành:\n\nThe manager said that the meeting was at 9 a.m.\n\n## 4. Cấu trúc cơ bản\n\n**Reporting verb + (that) + reported clause**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nShe said that she was busy.\n\nHe told me that he needed more time.\n\n## 5. Say và Tell\n\n### Say\n\nsay + that clause\n\nShe said that she was tired.\n\n### Tell\n\ntell + someone + that clause\n\nShe told me that she was tired.\n\n## 6. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nKhi chuyển Direct Speech sang Reported Speech, cần kiểm tra:\n\n1. Đại từ.\n2. Thì của động từ.\n3. Từ chỉ thời gian.\n4. Từ chỉ nơi chốn.\n5. Cấu trúc câu hỏi hoặc mệnh lệnh.\n\n	1	2026-08-08 20:23:10.289137	2026-08-08 20:23:10.289137	\N
588	51	Backshift - Lùi thì	\n\n# Backshift - Lùi thì\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nKhi reporting verb ở quá khứ, động từ trong mệnh đề tường thuật thường được lùi về một thì.\n\nĐây gọi là **backshift**.\n\n## 2. Present Simple → Past Simple\n\nDirect:\n\nThe manager said, "Sales are good."\n\nReported:\n\nThe manager said that sales were good.\n\n## 3. Present Continuous → Past Continuous\n\nDirect:\n\nShe said, "I am working."\n\nReported:\n\nShe said that she was working.\n\n## 4. Present Perfect → Past Perfect\n\nDirect:\n\nHe said, "I have finished the report."\n\nReported:\n\nHe said that he had finished the report.\n\n## 5. Past Simple → Past Perfect\n\nDirect:\n\nShe said, "I completed the project."\n\nReported:\n\nShe said that she had completed the project.\n\n## 6. Will → Would\n\nDirect:\n\nHe said, "I will call you."\n\nReported:\n\nHe said that he would call me.\n\n## 7. Can → Could\n\nDirect:\n\nShe said, "I can help."\n\nReported:\n\nShe said that she could help.\n\n## 8. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nNếu reporting verb là quá khứ như:\n\nsaid\n\ntold\n\nreported\n\nexplained\n\nthì hãy kiểm tra khả năng **lùi thì**.\n\n	2	2026-08-08 20:23:10.289137	2026-08-08 20:23:10.289137	\N
