696	61	Bẫy Advanced Conjunctions trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Conjunctions trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Bẫy Although\n\n______ the product is expensive, customers continue to buy it.\n\nA. Although\nB. Despite\nC. Because of\nD. Due to\n\nĐáp án: **A. Although**\n\n→ Sau although là **S + V**.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Bẫy Despite\n\n______ the high price, the product remains popular.\n\nA. Although\nB. Despite\nC. Even though\nD. Whereas\n\nĐáp án: **B. Despite**\n\n→ Sau despite là **noun phrase**.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Bẫy Because\n\nThe meeting was canceled ______ the manager was unavailable.\n\nA. because\nB. because of\nC. despite\nD. due to\n\nĐáp án: **A. because**\n\n→ Sau because là mệnh đề.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Bẫy Because Of\n\nThe flight was delayed ______ bad weather.\n\nA. because\nB. although\nC. because of\nD. whereas\n\nĐáp án: **C. because of**\n\n→ Sau because of là noun phrase.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Bẫy Unless\n\n______ you submit the application, it will not be processed.\n\nA. Unless\nB. Because\nC. Although\nD. Despite\n\nĐáp án: **A. Unless**\n\n→ Unless = if...not.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Bẫy Provided That\n\nEmployees may work remotely ______ they meet all deadlines.\n\nA. provided that\nB. despite\nC. whereas\nD. because of\n\nĐáp án: **A. provided that**\n\n→ Diễn tả điều kiện.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Bẫy So That\n\nThe company upgraded the system ______ customers could access it more easily.\n\nA. so that\nB. because of\nC. despite\nD. whereas\n\nĐáp án: **A. so that**\n\n→ So that + S + modal + V.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Bẫy So và Such\n\nThe report was ______ detailed that it took hours to review.\n\nA. such\nB. so\nC. very much\nD. many\n\nĐáp án: **B. so**\n\n→ so + adjective + that.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Bẫy Such\n\nIt was ______ important meeting that all managers attended.\n\nA. so\nB. such\nC. much\nD. very\n\nĐáp án: **B. such**\n\n→ such + adjective + noun + that.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Bẫy Whereas\n\nThe eastern branch focuses on sales, ______ the western branch focuses on research.\n\nA. whereas\nB. because\nC. unless\nD. despite\n\nĐáp án: **A. whereas**\n\n→ Whereas dùng để thể hiện sự tương phản giữa hai mệnh đề.\n\n## Mẹo tổng hợp\n\n### + Mệnh đề\n\n**although + S + V**\n\n**because + S + V**\n\n**unless + S + V**\n\n**whereas + S + V**\n\n**provided that + S + V**\n\n**so that + S + V**\n\n### + Danh từ / V-ing\n\n**despite + noun/V-ing**\n\n**in spite of + noun/V-ing**\n\n**because of + noun**\n\n**due to + noun**\n\n### Cấu trúc đặc biệt\n\n**so + adjective/adverb + that**\n\n**such + noun phrase + that**\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:28:23.954445	2026-08-08 20:28:23.954445	\N
697	62	Complex Prepositions là gì?	\n\n# Complex Prepositions là gì?\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nComplex Prepositions (giới từ phức hợp) là những từ hoặc cụm từ có chức năng giống giới từ và thường gồm **hai hoặc nhiều từ**.\n\nVí dụ:\n\n- because of\n- due to\n- owing to\n- in addition to\n- in spite of\n- instead of\n- according to\n- with regard to\n- in accordance with\n- on behalf of\n\n## 2. Cấu trúc chung\n\n**Complex Preposition + noun / noun phrase / V-ing**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nbecause of the delay\n\nin addition to the report\n\ninstead of working\n\n## 3. Ví dụ TOEIC\n\nThe flight was delayed because of bad weather.\n\nThe manager attended the meeting on behalf of the director.\n\n## 4. Complex Preposition và Conjunction\n\nMột số cấu trúc dễ nhầm:\n\n**because of + noun**\n\n**because + S + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe meeting was canceled because of the rain.\n\nThe meeting was canceled because it was raining.\n\n## 5. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nKhi gặp chỗ trống trước một danh từ hoặc cụm danh từ, hãy kiểm tra các **complex prepositions** phù hợp.\n\n	1	2026-08-08 20:28:48.312878	2026-08-08 20:28:48.312878	\N
