731	65	Động từ + Object + Bare Infinitive	\n\n# Verb + Object + Bare Infinitive\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nMột số động từ cho phép dùng:\n\n**verb + object + bare infinitive**\n\nBare infinitive = động từ nguyên mẫu **không có to**.\n\n## 2. Make\n\n**make + object + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager made employees work overtime.\n\nKhông dùng:\n\nmade employees to work ❌\n\n## 3. Let\n\n**let + object + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager let employees leave early.\n\n## 4. Have\n\nTrong cấu trúc sai khiến:\n\n**have + object + V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager had the assistant prepare the report.\n\n## 5. Help\n\nHelp có thể dùng:\n\n**help + object + V**\n\nhoặc:\n\n**help + object + to V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nShe helped me complete the form.\n\nShe helped me to complete the form.\n\n## 6. Bẫy TOEIC\n\nThe manager made the employees ______ overtime.\n\nA. worked\nB. working\nC. to work\nD. work\n\nĐáp án: **D. work**\n\n## 7. Mẹo\n\nNhớ nhóm:\n\n**make + O + V**\n\n**let + O + V**\n\n**have + O + V**\n\n	5	2026-08-08 20:31:17.849399	2026-08-08 20:31:17.849399	\N
732	65	Động từ + That-Clause	\n\n# Verb + That-Clause\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nMột số động từ thường theo sau bởi:\n\n**verb + that + S + V**\n\n## 2. Các động từ quan trọng\n\n- say that\n- think that\n- believe that\n- know that\n- explain that\n- report that\n- announce that\n- confirm that\n- indicate that\n- suggest that\n\n## 3. Ví dụ\n\nThe manager announced that the meeting had been canceled.\n\nThe report indicates that sales have increased.\n\nThe company confirmed that the order had been shipped.\n\n## 4. Say và Tell\n\n### Say\n\n**say + that-clause**\n\nThe manager said that the meeting was canceled.\n\n### Tell\n\n**tell + someone + that-clause**\n\nThe manager told employees that the meeting was canceled.\n\n## 5. Bẫy TOEIC\n\nThe report indicates ______ sales have increased.\n\nA. what\nB. that\nC. to\nD. for\n\nĐáp án: **B. that**\n\n## 6. Mẹo\n\nNhóm động từ:\n\n**believe / think / know / announce / report / confirm / indicate**\n\nthường có thể đi với:\n\n**that + clause**\n\n	6	2026-08-08 20:31:17.849399	2026-08-08 20:31:17.849399	\N
