824	74	Prepositions trong Collocations	\n\n# Prepositions trong Collocations\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nNhiều động từ, tính từ và danh từ thường đi với giới từ cố định.\n\nKhông nên dịch từng từ riêng lẻ.\n\n## 2. Verb + Preposition\n\nMột số cụm quan trọng:\n\n- depend on\n- apply for\n- participate in\n- belong to\n- refer to\n- respond to\n- agree with\n- focus on\n- result in\n- consist of\n\n## 3. Adjective + Preposition\n\n- responsible for\n- interested in\n- familiar with\n- capable of\n- aware of\n- satisfied with\n- concerned about\n- similar to\n\n## 4. Noun + Preposition\n\n- reason for\n- solution to\n- demand for\n- increase in\n- decrease in\n- access to\n- need for\n- responsibility for\n\n## 5. TOEIC\n\nThe manager is responsible ______ training new employees.\n\nA. of\nB. for\nC. with\nD. to\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. for**\n\n## 6. Mẹo\n\nHọc:\n\n**responsible for**\n\nthay vì chỉ học:\n\nresponsible = chịu trách nhiệm.\n\n	8	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	\N
825	74	Preposition sau Adjective và Verb	\n\n# Preposition sau Adjective và Verb\n\n## 1. Adjective + Preposition\n\n### Responsible for\n\nThe manager is responsible **for** the project.\n\n### Interested in\n\nCustomers are interested **in** the new product.\n\n### Familiar with\n\nEmployees are familiar **with** the new system.\n\n### Similar to\n\nThis product is similar **to** the previous model.\n\n### Capable of\n\nThe machine is capable **of** processing large amounts of data.\n\n## 2. Verb + Preposition\n\n### Depend on\n\nSuccess depends **on** good planning.\n\n### Apply for\n\nShe applied **for** the position.\n\n### Participate in\n\nEmployees participated **in** the training.\n\n### Respond to\n\nPlease respond **to** the email.\n\n## 3. TOEIC\n\nThe company is interested ______ expanding into new markets.\n\nA. at\nB. in\nC. on\nD. for\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. in**\n\n## 4. Mẹo\n\nCác cụm adjective/verb + preposition cần học như **collocation cố định**.\n\n	9	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	\N
826	74	Bẫy Advanced Prepositions trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Prepositions trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. By và Until\n\nEmployees must finish the report ______ Friday.\n\nA. until\nB. by\nC. during\nD. throughout\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. by**\n\n---\n\n## 2. For và During\n\nThe company has operated here ______ ten years.\n\nA. during\nB. for\nC. within\nD. by\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. for**\n\n---\n\n## 3. Despite\n\n______ the bad weather, the flight departed on time.\n\nA. Despite\nB. Although\nC. Because\nD. Unless\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. Despite**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Responsible for\n\nThe manager is responsible ______ hiring new employees.\n\nA. to\nB. for\nC. with\nD. at\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. for**\n\n---\n\n## 5. Interested in\n\nCustomers are interested ______ the new service.\n\nA. on\nB. at\nC. in\nD. for\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. in**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Participate in\n\nAll employees must participate ______ the training session.\n\nA. at\nB. on\nC. in\nD. for\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. in**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Depend on\n\nThe final decision depends ______ the manager.\n\nA. at\nB. in\nC. on\nD. for\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. on**\n\n---\n\n## 8. According to\n\n______ the latest report, sales increased by 10 percent.\n\nA. According to\nB. Despite\nC. Unless\nD. Beyond\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. According to**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Within\n\nPlease respond ______ three business days.\n\nA. beyond\nB. within\nC. among\nD. during\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. within**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp câu hỏi về giới từ:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nXác định từ đứng trước chỗ trống:\n\n- verb\n- adjective\n- noun\n\n### Bước 2\n\nKiểm tra collocation.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nresponsible → **for**\n\ninterested → **in**\n\ndepend → **on**\n\napply → **for**\n\n### Bước 3\n\nNếu là giới từ chỉ thời gian, xác định:\n\n- deadline → by\n- kéo dài → until\n- duration → for\n- sự kiện/khoảng thời gian → during\n- toàn bộ khoảng thời gian → throughout\n\n### Bước 4\n\nNếu là giới từ chỉ phạm vi:\n\n- within → trong giới hạn\n- beyond → vượt giới hạn\n- among → trong một nhóm\n- between → giữa các đối tượng xác định\n\n## Công thức nhớ\n\n**Verb + Preposition**\n\ndepend on\n\napply for\n\nparticipate in\n\nrespond to\n\n**Adjective + Preposition**\n\nresponsible for\n\ninterested in\n\nfamiliar with\n\ncapable of\n\n**Noun + Preposition**\n\nreason for\n\nsolution to\n\nincrease in\n\naccess to\n\n## Mẹo TOEIC\n\nVới giới từ nâng cao, **collocation quan trọng hơn dịch nghĩa từng từ**.\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	\N
