836	75	Bẫy Advanced Relative Clauses trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Relative Clauses trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Who / Whom\n\nThe employee ______ I interviewed was highly qualified.\n\nA. who\nB. whom\nC. whose\nD. which\n\nĐáp án chuẩn về ngữ pháp trang trọng:\n\n**B. whom**\n\n→ I interviewed him.\n\nTrong tiếng Anh hiện đại, who cũng thường được dùng trong thực tế.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Who làm chủ ngữ\n\nThe employee ______ manages the department is experienced.\n\nA. whom\nB. who\nC. which\nD. whose\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. who**\n\n→ who manages.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Whose\n\nThe employee ______ computer was damaged reported the problem.\n\nA. who\nB. whom\nC. whose\nD. which\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. whose**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Which\n\nThe report ______ was submitted yesterday contains several errors.\n\nA. who\nB. which\nC. whom\nD. where\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. which**\n\n---\n\n## 5. Where\n\nThe office ______ I work is downtown.\n\nA. when\nB. where\nC. why\nD. whose\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. where**\n\n---\n\n## 6. When\n\nThe day ______ the contract was signed was important.\n\nA. where\nB. when\nC. whose\nD. whom\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. when**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Restrictive\n\nThe employees ______ completed the training received certificates.\n\nA. which\nB. who\nC. where\nD. whose\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. who**\n\n---\n\n## 8. Nonrestrictive\n\nThe manager, ______ has worked here for ten years, will retire.\n\nA. that\nB. who\nC. where\nD. what\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. who**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Reduced Relative Clause\n\nThe documents ______ yesterday are confidential.\n\nA. submitting\nB. submitted\nC. submit\nD. submits\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. submitted**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp Relative Clause:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nXác định danh từ đứng trước.\n\n### Bước 2\n\nXác định người hay vật.\n\n### Bước 3\n\nXác định relative pronoun làm:\n\n- subject\n- object\n- possessive\n\n### Bước 4\n\nKiểm tra dấu phẩy.\n\n### Bước 5\n\nKiểm tra có thể dùng:\n\n- who\n- whom\n- whose\n- which\n- that\n- where\n- when\