856	77	Bẫy Advanced Passive Voice trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Passive Voice trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Modal Passive\n\nAll forms must ______ by Friday.\n\nA. submit\nB. be submitted\nC. submitted\nD. submitting\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. be submitted**\n\n---\n\n## 2. Perfect Passive\n\nThe report ______ before the meeting began.\n\nA. had been completed\nB. had completed\nC. has completing\nD. was complete\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. had been completed**\n\n---\n\n## 3. Future Perfect Passive\n\nBy next month, the project ______ completed.\n\nA. will have been\nB. will be\nC. has been\nD. had been\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. will have been**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Reporting Verb\n\nThe new product is expected ______ sales.\n\nA. increase\nB. to increase\nC. increasing\nD. increased\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. to increase**\n\n---\n\n## 5. Have Something Done\n\nThe company had the equipment ______.\n\nA. repair\nB. repaired\nC. repairing\nD. repairs\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. repaired**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Passive Infinitive\n\nThe machine needs ______ immediately.\n\nA. repair\nB. repairing\nC. to be repaired\nD. repaired\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. to be repaired**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Passive Gerund\n\nThe employee dislikes ______ in public.\n\nA. criticize\nB. criticized\nC. being criticized\nD. to criticize\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. being criticized**\n\n---\n\n## 8. Phrasal Verb\n\nThe meeting was ______ because of bad weather.\n\nA. called\nB. called off\nC. calling off\nD. call off\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. called off**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Two Objects\n\nThe employees were ______ additional training.\n\nA. provided\nB. providing\nC. provide\nD. provides\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. provided**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp Passive Voice:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nXác định chủ ngữ có phải là đối tượng chịu tác động không.\n\n### Bước 2\n\nXác định thì.\n\n### Bước 3\n\nKiểm tra dạng:\n\n**be + V3**\n\n### Bước 4\n\nNếu có modal:\n\n**modal + be + V3**\n\n### Bước 5\n\nNếu có hoàn thành:\n\n**have/has/had + been + V3**\n\n### Bước 6\n\nNếu có tương lai hoàn thành:\n\n**will have been + V3**\n\n### Bước 7\n\nKiểm tra cấu trúc đặc biệt:\n\n- be expected to V\n- be believed to V\n- have something done\n- get something done\n- being + V3\n- to be + V3\n\n## Công thức nhớ\n\n**Present Passive:**\n\nam/is/are + V3\n\n**Past Passive:**\n\nwas/were + V3\n\n**Perfect Passive:**\n\nhave/has/had + been + V3\n\n**Future Passive:**\n\nwill be + V3\n\n**Modal Passive:**\n\nmodal + be + V3\n\n**Passive Infinitive:**\n\nto be + V3\n\n**Passive Gerund:**\n\nbeing + V3\n\n**Causative:**\n\nhave/get + object + V3\n\n## Mẹo TOEIC\n\nĐừng chọn V3 chỉ vì nhìn thấy chủ ngữ là vật.\n\nHãy kiểm tra **thì + trợ động từ + quan hệ chủ động/bị động**.\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:38:39.273274	2026-08-08 20:38:39.273274	\N
857	78	Advanced Reported Speech là gì?	\n\n# Advanced Reported Speech là gì?\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nReported Speech (câu tường thuật) dùng để thuật lại:\n\n- lời nói\n- câu hỏi\n- yêu cầu\n- mệnh lệnh\n- thông báo\n- ý kiến\n\nmà không lặp lại nguyên văn lời nói ban đầu.\n\n### Direct Speech\n\nThe manager said, "We need more time."\n\n### Reported Speech\n\nThe manager said that they needed more time.\n\n## 2. Hai thành phần\n\nReported Speech thường gồm:\n\n**Reporting verb + reported clause**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager **said that** the project was delayed.\n\n## 3. Reporting verbs thường gặp\n\n- say\n- tell\n- ask\n- explain\n- report\n- announce\n- inform\n- remind\n- warn\n- advise\n- promise\n- suggest\n- recommend\n\n## 4. TOEIC\n\nReported Speech thường xuất hiện trong:\n\n- email\n- thông báo\n- báo cáo\n- cuộc họp\n- lời nhắn\n- câu hỏi ngữ pháp\n\n## 5. Mẹo\n\nKhi chuyển từ Direct → Reported Speech, cần kiểm tra:\n\n1. thì\n2. đại từ\n3. trạng từ thời gian\n4. trạng từ nơi chốn\n5. cấu trúc của reporting verb\n\n	1	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	\N
858	78	Backshift of Tenses	\n\n# Backshift of Tenses\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nKhi reporting verb ở quá khứ, thì trong reported clause thường lùi một bậc.\n\n## 2. Present Simple → Past Simple\n\nDirect:\n\n"I work here."\n\nReported:\n\nShe said that she **worked** there.\n\n## 3. Present Continuous → Past Continuous\n\n"I am working."\n\n→ She said that she **was working**.\n\n## 4. Present Perfect → Past Perfect\n\n"I have finished the report."\n\n→ He said that he **had finished** the report.\n\n## 5. Past Simple → Past Perfect\n\n"I completed the project."\n\n→ She said that she **had completed** the project.\n\n## 6. Will → Would\n\n"I will call you."\n\n→ He said that he **would call** me.\n\n## 7. Can → Could\n\n"I can help."\n\n→ She said that she **could help**.\n\n## 8. Mẹo\n\nNhớ chuỗi:\n\n**Present → Past**\n\n**Past → Past Perfect**\n\n**Will → Would**\n\n**Can → Could**\n\n	2	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	\N
