870	79	Gerund và Infinitive sau Preposition	\n\n# Gerund và Infinitive sau Preposition\n\n## 1. Sau giới từ dùng Gerund\n\nSau preposition, nếu cần động từ thì dùng:\n\n**V-ing**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager is interested in **improving** productivity.\n\nShe is responsible for **training** employees.\n\n## 2. Một số cấu trúc\n\n- interested in doing\n- responsible for doing\n- capable of doing\n- good at doing\n- before doing\n- after doing\n- without doing\n\n## 3. Ví dụ\n\nThe company improved efficiency by **using** new software.\n\nEmployees left without **informing** the manager.\n\n## 4. "To" có thể là Preposition\n\nĐây là một bẫy quan trọng.\n\nCác cụm:\n\n- look forward to\n- be accustomed to\n- be committed to\n- object to\n- be opposed to\n\nSau "to" trong các cụm này dùng **V-ing**.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nWe look forward to **meeting** you.\n\nKhông dùng:\n\nlook forward to meet.\n\n## 5. TOEIC\n\nWe look forward to ______ from you.\n\nA. hear\nB. hearing\nC. heard\nD. to hear\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. hearing**\n\n	4	2026-08-08 20:39:30.132946	2026-08-08 20:39:30.132946	\N
