929	81	Dấu chấm phẩy Semicolon	\n\n# Dấu chấm phẩy (Semicolon)\n\n## 1. Công dụng\n\nSemicolon (;) có thể nối hai independent clauses có liên quan chặt chẽ.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe meeting ended; the employees returned to work.\n\nHai bên đều có thể đứng thành câu riêng.\n\n## 2. Với conjunctive adverbs\n\nCó thể dùng:\n\n**independent clause; however, independent clause.**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe product is expensive; however, it is very reliable.\n\nCác conjunctive adverbs thường gặp:\n\n- however\n- therefore\n- moreover\n- nevertheless\n- consequently\n- furthermore\n- otherwise\n\n## 3. Không nhầm với conjunction\n\nSai:\n\nThe product is expensive; but it is reliable.\n\nThông thường:\n\nThe product is expensive, but it is reliable.\n\n## 4. However\n\nĐúng:\n\nThe product is expensive; however, it is reliable.\n\nHoặc:\n\nThe product is expensive. However, it is reliable.\n\n## 5. Therefore\n\nThe company reduced costs; therefore, profits increased.\n\n## 6. TOEIC\n\nThe deadline was extended; ______, several employees still requested additional time.\n\nA. however\nB. therefore\nC. because\nD. although\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. however**\n\n	3	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	\N
