934	81	Dấu phẩy trong danh sách và Parallel Structure	\n\n# Commas và Parallel Structure\n\n## 1. Danh sách\n\nCác thành phần cùng chức năng được ngăn cách bằng dấu phẩy.\n\nThe company sells computers, printers, and software.\n\n## 2. Oxford Comma\n\nDấu phẩy trước and trong danh sách ba thành phần:\n\ncomputers, printers, **and** software.\n\nTrong tiếng Anh Mỹ, Oxford comma thường được sử dụng để tăng tính rõ ràng.\n\n## 3. Parallel Structure\n\nCác thành phần trong danh sách nên có cùng dạng.\n\nĐúng:\n\nThe job requires **planning, organizing, and communicating**.\n\nSai:\n\nThe job requires **planning, organizing, and to communicate**.\n\n## 4. Không dùng dấu phẩy giữa subject và verb\n\nSai:\n\nThe manager, along with the employees, **is** responsible.\n\nCó thể dùng dấu phẩy để bao quanh cụm bổ sung:\n\nThe manager, along with the employees, is responsible.\n\nNhưng không:\n\nThe manager, is responsible.\n\n## 5. TOEIC\n\nThe position requires excellent communication, organizational, and ______ skills.\n\nA. leadership\nB. lead\nC. leading\nD. to lead\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. leadership**\n\n	8	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	\N
935	81	Dấu phẩy với Introductory Phrases và Transitional Expressions	\n\n# Introductory Phrases và Transitional Expressions\n\n## 1. Cụm mở đầu\n\nCụm trạng từ đứng đầu câu thường được ngăn cách bằng dấu phẩy.\n\nAfter reviewing the report, the manager approved the proposal.\n\n## 2. Transitional Expressions\n\nCác từ như:\n\n- however\n- therefore\n- moreover\n- in addition\n- nevertheless\n- consequently\n- for example\n- in fact\n\nthường cần dấu câu phù hợp.\n\n## 3. However\n\nĐúng:\n\nHowever, the company decided to continue.\n\nHoặc:\n\nThe company, however, decided to continue.\n\nHoặc:\n\nThe company decided to continue; however, sales remained low.\n\n## 4. Therefore\n\nĐúng:\n\nTherefore, we decided to postpone the meeting.\n\nHoặc:\n\nThe weather was bad; therefore, the event was canceled.\n\n## 5. Không nối hai independent clauses chỉ bằng comma\n\nSai:\n\nThe weather was bad, therefore the event was canceled.\n\nĐúng:\n\nThe weather was bad; therefore, the event was canceled.\n\n## 6. TOEIC\n\nThe report was incomplete; ______, the manager requested a revision.\n\nA. however\nB. therefore\nC. although\nD. because\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. therefore**\n\n	9	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	\N
936	81	Bẫy Punctuation Grammar trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Punctuation Grammar trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Relative Clause\n\nThe manager, ______ has extensive experience, will lead the project.\n\nA. that\nB. who\nC. where\nD. what\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. who**\n\n→ Non-defining Relative Clause cần dấu phẩy.\n\n---\n\n## 2. However\n\nThe product is expensive; ______, it is reliable.\n\nA. however\nB. because\nC. although\nD. and\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. however**\n\n→ ; however,\n\n---\n\n## 3. Introductory Clause\n\n______ the meeting ended, the employees returned to work.\n\nA. After\nB. After,\nC. After the meeting,\nD. The meeting after\n\nNếu chọn cụm:\n\n**After the meeting ended, the employees returned to work.**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Compound Sentence\n\nThe manager arrived, ______ the meeting began.\n\nA. and\nB. however\nC. therefore\nD. because\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. and**\n\n→ comma + coordinating conjunction.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Possessive\n\nThe ______ office is on the second floor.\n\nA. manager\nB. managers\nC. manager's\nD. managers\n\nNếu một manager:\n\n**C. manager's**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Compound Modifier\n\nThe company offers a ______ training program.\n\nA. two-weeks\nB. two-week\nC. two weeks\nD. two-weeks-long\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. two-week**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Colon\n\nThe company requires three things: ______.\n\nA. experience, dedication, and flexibility\nB. employees have experience\nC. which include experience\nD. because experience is important\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. experience, dedication, and flexibility**\n\n---\n\n## 8. Parallelism\n\nThe job involves answering calls, handling complaints, and ______ reports.\n\nA. prepare\nB. preparing\nC. preparation\nD. to prepare\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. preparing**\n\n→ answering, handling, preparing.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Semicolon\n\nThe deadline was extended; ______, several employees still requested more time.\n\nA. however\nB. although\nC. because\nD. and\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. however**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp câu hỏi về punctuation:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nKiểm tra xem hai bên dấu câu có phải **independent clauses** hay không.\n\nNếu có:\n\n**Clause; however, Clause**\n\nhoặc:\n\n**Clause, and Clause**\n\n### Bước 2\n\nKiểm tra Relative Clause.\n\n**Defining → không có dấu phẩy**\n\n**Non-defining → có dấu phẩy**\n\n### Bước 3\n\nKiểm tra introductory phrase/clause.\n\nMệnh đề/cụm mở đầu thường được ngăn cách bằng dấu phẩy.\n\n### Bước 4\n\nKiểm tra sở hữu.\n\n**singular noun + 's**\n\n**plural noun ending in s + '**\n\n### Bước 5\n\nKiểm tra compound modifier.\n\n**a five-year contract**\n\nkhông:\n\n**a five-years contract**\n\n### Bước 6\n\nNhận diện conjunctive adverbs.\n\n**however, therefore, moreover, nevertheless**\n\nKhi nối hai independent clauses:\n\n**Clause; however, Clause.**\n\n## Công thức nhớ\n\n**Introductory clause, main clause.**\n\n**Main clause, and main clause.**\n\n**Main clause; however, main clause.**\n\n**Defining relative clause → không comma.**\n\n**Non-defining relative clause → comma.**\n\n**singular possessive → 's**\n\n**plural possessive → s'**\n\n**number + singular noun → compound modifier**\n\n**soạn danh sách → comma**\n\n**parallel items → cùng dạng ngữ pháp**\n\n## Mẹo TOEIC\n\nPunctuation không chỉ là "nhìn dấu phẩy".\n\nHãy xác định **cấu trúc ngữ pháp phía sau dấu câu**.\n\nĐặc biệt nhớ 4 bẫy:\n\n1. **comma splice**\n2. **however/therefore**\n3. **defining vs non-defining relative clause**\n4. **compound modifiers**\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	2026-08-08 20:51:01.534264	\N
