COPY public.reading_questions (id, group_id, question_number, question_text, question_type, explanation, knowledge, correct_answer, display_order, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
1	1	1	The company needs to hire an additional _____ to manage its growing customer base.	grammar	After 'an additional', a singular countable noun is needed. 'Manager' fits the sentence.	Danh từ đứng sau mạo từ	A	1	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
2	2	2	The marketing team developed a _____ strategy to increase online sales.	grammar	A noun is needed after the article and before 'strategy'. 'Successful' is the correct adjective.	Tính từ đứng trước danh từ	B	2	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
3	3	3	The technician repaired the machine _____ and returned it to the production line.	grammar	The adverb 'carefully' modifies the verb 'repaired'.	Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho động từ	C	3	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
4	4	4	The director praised the employees for their _____ to the project.	grammar	After 'their', a noun is required. 'Dedication' is the correct noun.	Danh từ đứng sau từ hạn định sở hữu	D	4	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
5	5	5	The new software system is extremely _____ to use.	grammar	The linking verb 'is' is followed by an adjective. 'Convenient' is correct.	Tính từ đứng sau động từ liên kết (linking verb)	A	5	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
6	6	6	The instructions were _____ clear to all participants.	grammar	The adverb 'completely' modifies the adjective 'clear'.	Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho tính từ	B	6	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
7	7	7	_____ of the new policy will begin next Monday.	grammar	A noun is needed as the subject of the sentence. 'Implementation' is correct.	Danh từ làm chủ ngữ	C	7	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
8	8	8	The documents submitted by the applicant were _____.	grammar	After 'were', an adjective is needed to describe the documents. 'Accurate' is correct.	Tính từ làm bổ ngữ cho chủ ngữ	D	8	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
9	9	9	The manager is responsible for the _____ of all company records.	grammar	After 'for the', a noun is needed. 'Maintenance' fits the sentence.	Danh từ đứng sau giới từ	A	9	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
10	10	10	The new policy is _____ different from the previous one.	grammar	The adverb 'significantly' modifies the adjective 'different'.	Trạng từ bổ nghĩa cho tính từ	B	10	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
11	11	11	The list of available products _____ updated every Friday.	grammar	The main subject is singular 'list', so the singular verb 'is' is required.	Chủ ngữ số ít đi kèm cụm giới từ	A	11	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
12	12	12	The employees in the accounting department _____ required to attend the meeting.	grammar	The subject 'employees' is plural, so 'are' is correct.	Chủ ngữ số nhiều	B	12	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
13	13	13	Each of the applicants _____ required to submit two references.	grammar	'Each' takes a singular verb, so 'is' is correct.	Each + động từ số ít	C	13	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
14	14	14	Neither the manager nor the assistants _____ available this afternoon.	grammar	With 'neither...nor', the verb agrees with the nearer subject, 'assistants', which is plural.	Sự hòa hợp với cấu trúc Neither...nor	D	14	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
15	15	15	The information about the new products _____ available on the website.	grammar	'Information' is uncountable and takes a singular verb.	Danh từ không đếm được	A	15	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
16	16	16	A number of customers _____ complained about the delayed delivery.	grammar	'A number of' is followed by a plural noun and plural verb.	A number of + danh từ số nhiều	B	16	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622	2026-08-10 11:31:21.892622
